WEBVTT

02:09.552 --> 02:12.289
EV conversion really quieted it down,
didn't it?

02:12.289 --> 02:15.625
You held the corners tight,
handling was sharp as ever.

02:15.625 --> 02:18.151
Maybe try F1 next, Chairman.

02:18.151 --> 02:22.299
The cell temp is over 35, so output's capped.

02:22.299 --> 02:25.135
Talk to research about swapping it out.

02:25.135 --> 02:26.937
Higher energy density.

02:26.937 --> 02:28.538
Yes, Chairman.

02:32.309 --> 02:35.812
Not one of them I can trust.

02:39.880 --> 02:43.765
The sun rises right on time,

02:44.521 --> 02:49.025
so why can't people
toughen up after a lifetime?

02:50.260 --> 02:51.543
Sang Jae.

02:51.543 --> 02:53.502
Yes, Chairman.

02:53.502 --> 02:55.501
Call in the presidents.

02:55.501 --> 02:57.600
Tell them I have something to say.

03:07.210 --> 03:08.754
Let's go.

04:24.988 --> 04:26.953
We watched you for a month,

04:26.953 --> 04:28.767
and that grit and drive

04:28.767 --> 04:31.428
are what set you apart.

04:31.428 --> 04:32.465
Thank you.

04:32.465 --> 04:34.364
Time for the first division.

04:34.364 --> 04:36.600
Come to Choiseong.

04:36.600 --> 04:38.567
Seriously?

04:38.567 --> 04:40.537
I'm really playing for Choiseong.

04:40.537 --> 04:41.738
Thank you!

04:41.738 --> 04:43.006
Thank you!

04:43.006 --> 04:44.240
Welcome aboard.

04:44.240 --> 04:46.816
[A signing-on fee of 500 million won
shall be paid to the Player]

04:50.380 --> 04:52.043
[The player, Hwang Jun Hyeon]

04:53.483 --> 04:56.225
Hwang Jun Hyeon, a few words?

04:56.225 --> 04:57.987
I'll give it my all.

04:57.987 --> 04:59.656
I'll work my tail off

04:59.656 --> 05:02.525
and take Choiseong FC to the title.

05:47.600 --> 05:50.339
The Chairman is arriving.

05:51.500 --> 05:53.442
Good morning, Chairman.

05:55.567 --> 05:57.613
Good morning, Chairman.

06:01.050 --> 06:03.443
[Chairman Kang Yong Ho]

06:07.490 --> 06:09.881
[Chairman Kang Yong Ho]

06:44.227 --> 06:46.420
[Chairman Kang Yong Ho]

06:50.934 --> 06:52.034
Sit.

06:52.034 --> 06:54.604
- Good morning, Chairman.
- Good morning, Chairman.

06:55.672 --> 06:57.195
[President Kang Jae Seong]

07:05.016 --> 07:08.051
Choiseong Construction, President Park Gi Mok.

07:08.051 --> 07:10.486
Yes, Chairman.

07:10.486 --> 07:13.323
You've got time to drink.

07:13.323 --> 07:15.024
Must be nice.

07:15.725 --> 07:17.662
How did you...

07:17.662 --> 07:20.268
A toast to rally the team would've done,

07:20.268 --> 07:22.699
so why are you the one being poured for?

07:22.699 --> 07:24.001
Don't tell me

07:24.001 --> 07:26.669
your pockets came home full too?

07:26.669 --> 07:28.461
Absolutely not, sir!

07:28.461 --> 07:31.307
The drinks were all on me.

07:34.411 --> 07:38.946
Our goal this year was top five, right?

07:38.946 --> 07:40.416
But at this rate,

07:40.416 --> 07:43.620
we'll drop below tenth before long.

07:43.620 --> 07:47.037
Know why I hit the track every dawn?

07:47.037 --> 07:49.025
To torture you?

07:49.025 --> 07:50.927
Some grudge against cars?

07:50.927 --> 07:52.861
No.

07:55.131 --> 07:57.709
To keep my edge.

07:57.709 --> 08:00.370
What drove me to build Choiseong,

08:00.370 --> 08:03.807
what helps us, what hurts us,

08:03.807 --> 08:06.009
every second,

08:07.144 --> 08:10.356
I drill it back in.

08:14.801 --> 08:16.852
So I've decided.

08:17.820 --> 08:21.718
It's time I step away and enjoy retirement.

08:21.718 --> 08:25.527
Choiseong should go to quicker feet.

08:27.264 --> 08:29.532
What's making you do this, sir?

08:29.532 --> 08:31.802
I'm not what I used to be.

08:31.802 --> 08:35.004
My speed, my cornering, all dull,

08:35.004 --> 08:37.273
and my memory keeps slipping.

08:37.273 --> 08:41.411
Strategic Planning will run the succession,

08:41.411 --> 08:43.627
so I want everyone fully on board.

08:43.627 --> 08:45.548
- Yes, Chairman.
- Yes, Chairman.

08:46.590 --> 08:49.752
Yes, Chairman?

08:51.901 --> 08:54.967
Back then, when a king named his heir,

08:54.967 --> 08:58.060
every subject begged him to stay,

08:58.848 --> 09:01.609
but you all must have been counting the days

09:01.609 --> 09:03.999
for me to clear out.

09:06.336 --> 09:09.731
Not one of you pushed back.

09:09.731 --> 09:11.034
- No, Chairman.
- No, Chairman.

09:11.034 --> 09:12.456
That isn't true at all.

09:12.456 --> 09:14.577
You're still going strong, sir.

09:14.577 --> 09:17.681
Kang Jae Gyeong, Kang Jae Seong,

09:18.333 --> 09:23.634
bring me results
that'll win the board in a month.

09:23.634 --> 09:26.422
I'll make my call then.

09:30.400 --> 09:31.961
That's all.

09:34.531 --> 09:36.600
Chairman.

09:36.600 --> 09:39.200
Father.

09:42.372 --> 09:44.240
So what now?

09:44.240 --> 09:47.864
Should we kneel in the lobby and beg?

09:47.864 --> 09:50.351
He could at least drop a hint,

09:50.351 --> 09:53.349
but he wants us to crawl to the twins.

09:54.189 --> 09:57.954
He handed him Trading for being the eldest,

09:57.954 --> 10:00.290
and every deal he touches goes bust.

10:00.290 --> 10:03.133
Aside from handing posts
to his buddies and in-laws,

10:03.133 --> 10:04.150
what has he done?

10:04.150 --> 10:05.695
What about Kang Jae Gyeong?

10:05.695 --> 10:08.201
She grows Chemicals a bit
and walks around with her nose up,

10:08.201 --> 10:10.533
treating her staff like dirt,
and that's nothing new.

10:10.533 --> 10:12.091
My vote's for President Kang Jae Gyeong.

10:12.091 --> 10:16.134
You saw President Kang Jae Seong,
still half asleep.

10:16.134 --> 10:18.874
Father.

10:19.700 --> 10:23.479
Not a word yesterday and now a succession?

10:23.479 --> 10:25.253
Stop blindsiding your kids.

10:25.253 --> 10:27.212
Decide now.

10:27.212 --> 10:28.593
I'm ready, Father.

10:28.593 --> 10:30.086
You think I'm not?

10:30.086 --> 10:32.864
When it comes to confidence, that's me.

10:32.864 --> 10:35.158
By natural order, the chair's mine.

10:35.158 --> 10:37.527
Doesn't Choiseong run on firstborn succession?

10:37.527 --> 10:39.168
You never once treated me

10:39.168 --> 10:40.596
differently for being a girl.

10:40.596 --> 10:42.253
You signed me up for boxing over ballet,

10:42.253 --> 10:44.934
and I remember how you lit up
when I floored those boys.

10:44.934 --> 10:48.392
Choiseong runs on merit.

10:48.392 --> 10:51.441
What, want me to tell him
one of those boys was you?

10:51.441 --> 10:54.667
Where are your manners with your big brother?

10:54.667 --> 10:57.913
Fifty seconds older
and you play the big brother.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.951
The stage is set,

11:01.951 --> 11:04.685
so fight it out for a month.

11:04.685 --> 11:06.523
You're both so sure,

11:06.523 --> 11:11.727
we'll find out who's dirty and who's lacking.

11:27.244 --> 11:29.712
Get every Trading exec in here.

11:31.210 --> 11:34.517
Redo every division's performance report.

11:34.517 --> 11:37.189
Where are we on Yuncheon Port
and the coal terminal?

11:37.189 --> 11:39.922
The environmental groups are pushing back hard.

11:39.922 --> 11:41.858
And the locals aren't happy either.

11:41.858 --> 11:45.108
So we just sit on our hands?

11:45.108 --> 11:47.542
Tell them we'll meet their terms,

11:47.542 --> 11:49.699
just sweet-talk them.

11:49.699 --> 11:51.688
Look at Director Song,

11:51.688 --> 11:54.268
solar plant up and running,

11:54.268 --> 11:57.006
hydrogen plant moving along smoothly.

11:57.006 --> 11:58.700
Sir, about that,

11:58.700 --> 12:00.809
Opung City isn't being cooperative.

12:00.809 --> 12:03.813
We may need to scale it back.

12:03.813 --> 12:06.883
We should be inflating it, not shrinking it.

12:06.883 --> 12:09.034
Scale back?

12:09.034 --> 12:11.587
The Singapore mall site,

12:11.587 --> 12:14.566
the fire recovery costs are no joke, sir.

12:14.566 --> 12:17.346
Are you all praying I lose the chair?

12:17.346 --> 12:19.725
Is this whole room working for Kang Jae Gyeong?

12:19.725 --> 12:22.198
Bury the losses out of sight,

12:22.198 --> 12:25.306
and pump the rest up as big as it'll go.

12:25.306 --> 12:28.166
That's how we beat Choiseong Chemicals!
Are we clear?

12:28.166 --> 12:30.039
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

12:30.039 --> 12:32.875
Of Choiseong Chemicals' recent wins,

12:32.875 --> 12:36.445
what's the biggest one in your eyes?

12:36.445 --> 12:38.215
The crown jewel for Chemicals

12:38.215 --> 12:40.349
is Choiseong Energy, hands down.

12:40.349 --> 12:42.764
Our lithium-ion battery locked down

12:42.764 --> 12:44.787
the small-cell market,

12:44.787 --> 12:47.890
and we're pushing hard on solid-state

12:47.890 --> 12:50.935
to solve the overheating issue at its root.

12:50.935 --> 12:54.096
Choiseong Chemical
is the main driver of Choiseong.

12:54.096 --> 12:56.495
I'm confident we'll be the driving force

12:56.495 --> 12:59.435
that lifts Korea's economy
in the global battery market.

13:02.605 --> 13:04.154
Owning the narrative is key.

13:04.154 --> 13:06.943
- Secretary Yeo, push the article.
- Pushing it now.

13:06.943 --> 13:08.911
The press play kicks it off.

13:08.911 --> 13:11.147
I'll send the release and start the pitches.

13:11.147 --> 13:12.300
[Future of Choiseong, Leader Kang Jae Gyeong]

13:12.300 --> 13:14.884
- Push it out now, please.
- Got it.

13:14.884 --> 13:17.086
[Please find the attached
press release for your review]

13:17.086 --> 13:19.209
[Future of Choiseong, Leader Kang Jae Gyeong]
["Core is Battery R&D"]

13:20.801 --> 13:21.857
[President Kang Jae Gyeong is incredible]

13:21.857 --> 13:23.025
[Choiseong plus batteries equals number one]

13:23.025 --> 13:24.827
[Chemicals stock is going up! Let's ride!]

13:24.827 --> 13:26.028
[Recommend, Like, Insightful, Angry]

13:26.028 --> 13:27.662
[Recommend, Support, Sad, Want a follow-up]

13:47.750 --> 13:51.388
[Certificate of Merit]
[Certificate of Distinguished Service Medal]

13:51.388 --> 13:54.385
Have you really made up your mind, Chairman?

13:54.385 --> 13:57.894
Every business group now
has a chairman in their 40s or 50s.

13:57.894 --> 13:59.484
And besides,

14:00.134 --> 14:02.398
I've already said I'm stepping down.

14:05.635 --> 14:09.333
The twins will come charging,

14:09.333 --> 14:13.015
and others will line up behind them.

14:13.015 --> 14:16.413
You're going to split them into camps?

14:16.413 --> 14:19.356
You want infighting inside the group?

14:21.001 --> 14:23.118
The bigger the chaos,

14:24.774 --> 14:27.790
the clearer the wheat from the chaff.

14:29.607 --> 14:33.262
Not one of them sits right with you,

14:33.262 --> 14:36.498
so you'll seat whoever rallies the most support

14:37.133 --> 14:39.740
and rule from behind the scenes.

14:42.472 --> 14:45.019
Lee Sang Jae,

14:45.019 --> 14:48.300
I should have had you as my own.

14:48.300 --> 14:49.645
Right?

14:49.645 --> 14:50.885
[Approval]

14:55.057 --> 14:56.653
Where are you off to, sir?

14:56.653 --> 14:59.279
I figured I'd clock out on time for once.

14:59.978 --> 15:01.690
Clocking out.

15:07.700 --> 15:10.332
The Chairman is leaving.

15:33.699 --> 15:36.493
Where are we on what I ordered?

16:24.641 --> 16:26.983
It's seafood stew, dear.

16:33.134 --> 16:34.650
This is good.

16:36.219 --> 16:38.654
The oysters were so fresh,

16:38.654 --> 16:41.683
they practically begged me to take them home.

16:41.683 --> 16:43.527
The seasons turn and your energy dips.

16:43.527 --> 16:45.777
Honey.

16:45.777 --> 16:47.296
Save it.

16:48.364 --> 16:49.634
End of verse one,

16:49.634 --> 16:51.367
no verse two.

16:51.367 --> 16:54.501
You two, no business talk at the table

16:54.501 --> 16:56.305
so your father can eat in peace.

16:56.305 --> 17:00.099
The battery project is getting great buzz.

17:00.099 --> 17:02.111
The solid-state news even pushed

17:02.111 --> 17:05.381
the group's stock up. Did you see?

17:05.381 --> 17:07.750
The stock rose thanks to Choiseong Trading

17:07.750 --> 17:11.787
making news with the Yuncheon SOC project.

17:11.787 --> 17:14.567
The article about our 30,000-ton
coal terminal berth

17:14.567 --> 17:16.125
at Yuncheon Port.

17:16.125 --> 17:19.695
Locals and environmental groups
are protesting it.

17:19.695 --> 17:22.298
Expanding the port creates jobs.

17:22.298 --> 17:23.756
Their protests won't get them anywhere.

17:23.756 --> 17:26.201
Got any leverage to shut them down?

17:30.001 --> 17:33.780
Since when does a company
sweat citizens and activists?

17:33.780 --> 17:35.778
That's a job for the bureaucrats,

17:35.778 --> 17:39.541
you crunch the numbers
and call it profit or loss.

17:39.541 --> 17:41.383
Honestly,

17:41.383 --> 17:44.653
how are you fit to be chair?

17:44.653 --> 17:46.154
The chairmanship?

17:46.154 --> 17:48.960
You're handing it down already?

17:48.960 --> 17:50.220
What do you mean, already?

17:50.220 --> 17:53.763
Father has worked his whole life,

17:53.763 --> 17:56.098
he should get some rest.

17:57.067 --> 17:59.935
He could travel with you,

17:59.935 --> 18:01.239
wouldn't that be nice?

18:01.239 --> 18:04.152
Not a word and out of nowhere?

18:04.152 --> 18:07.076
Is something broken in you?

18:07.076 --> 18:09.812
Did you catch something you haven't told me?

18:09.812 --> 18:11.713
Enough nonsense.

18:12.349 --> 18:15.364
I'll soak after dinner. My body feels heavy.

18:17.700 --> 18:20.656
Chairman, I'm here.

18:20.656 --> 18:23.027
What brings you here at this hour?

18:23.027 --> 18:27.464
The Chairman said he'd hit the track,
so I came to pick him up.

18:27.464 --> 18:29.999
He wants to test the new battery.

18:29.999 --> 18:32.401
You didn't say anything,

18:32.401 --> 18:35.665
you were just heading for a soak.

18:35.665 --> 18:37.873
There's a thrill to night driving.

18:39.875 --> 18:41.678
Your timing's perfect.

19:08.804 --> 19:10.586
Why can't I ever reach you?

19:10.586 --> 19:12.175
What? I'm busy.

19:12.175 --> 19:15.310
Looks like your father's stepping down.

19:16.512 --> 19:20.083
Get on your sister and brother's good side

19:20.083 --> 19:22.384
and let's bring you back to Korea.

19:22.384 --> 19:25.734
Once succession is set
and they see you want no share,

19:25.734 --> 19:28.502
would they really keep you in America forever?

19:28.502 --> 19:30.826
What, do I come and go on your command?

19:30.826 --> 19:32.761
Isn't it morning in New York?

19:32.761 --> 19:34.361
Why is it so loud?

19:34.361 --> 19:35.831
Were you out clubbing all night?

19:35.831 --> 19:36.962
I'm hanging up.

19:36.962 --> 19:38.534
Bang Geul.

19:38.534 --> 19:40.135
Kang Bang Geul.

19:45.500 --> 19:47.676
The director's glass is empty.

19:47.676 --> 19:49.233
Yes.

19:49.233 --> 19:51.013
I'll be right back in.

19:51.013 --> 19:54.370
Which team are you on again?

19:54.370 --> 19:57.888
Materials Team 2 intern, Casey Kang.

19:57.888 --> 20:00.201
Okay.

20:00.201 --> 20:01.467
Let's go.

20:01.467 --> 20:03.759
Let's go.

20:03.759 --> 20:05.694
Offshore slush funds?

20:05.694 --> 20:08.503
We've confirmed 300 billion
under Kang Jae Seong,

20:08.503 --> 20:10.566
and 350 billion under Kang Jae Gyeong

20:10.566 --> 20:11.834
[Special Audit Report: Corporate Slush Funds]
in hidden funds.

20:11.834 --> 20:15.305
You couldn't have dug this up
in just a few days.

20:16.038 --> 20:18.659
Did you wait for the announcement?

20:18.659 --> 20:19.920
To throw me under the bus?

20:19.920 --> 20:21.011
I'm sorry, sir.

20:21.011 --> 20:23.178
I had to verify it twice.

20:25.039 --> 20:27.282
So it's airtight.

20:30.319 --> 20:32.852
Your head's full, why not run a lap first?

20:32.852 --> 20:34.621
That's why I brought you here.

20:34.621 --> 20:37.221
A slap on the wrist and a pat on the back?

20:37.221 --> 20:39.728
Walking's the right move now.

20:49.300 --> 20:51.573
The Chairman just left.

21:23.105 --> 21:25.030
You scared me.

21:26.319 --> 21:27.466
Did you follow me?

21:27.466 --> 21:30.313
Director Lee called Father out here,
it's obvious.

21:30.313 --> 21:32.848
He's slipping him something on the sly.

21:33.715 --> 21:36.486
And it's about us.

21:36.486 --> 21:38.386
You've got dirt too?

21:39.623 --> 21:42.457
As dirty as the one tailing him?

21:43.092 --> 21:44.746
This is mine.

21:44.746 --> 21:46.506
Hand it over while I'm asking nicely.

21:46.506 --> 21:47.686
Hands off.

21:47.686 --> 21:49.865
There you go again.

21:52.969 --> 21:55.730
Battery swap done?

21:55.730 --> 21:58.306
Manager Jang handled it.

22:00.433 --> 22:03.011
I'll take a lap.

22:03.928 --> 22:05.908
No matter how far I walk,

22:06.600 --> 22:09.258
my head won't cool down.

22:09.258 --> 22:11.186
Give it back.

22:11.788 --> 22:13.876
I swear, you.

22:15.557 --> 22:16.567
- What?
- What was that?

22:16.567 --> 22:18.527
Father didn't leave?

22:18.527 --> 22:20.058
- Floor it.
- What?

22:20.058 --> 22:23.064
We're caught red-handed.
We're done, just floor it!

22:36.278 --> 22:38.046
What happened here?

22:45.234 --> 22:46.922
Unreal.

22:55.901 --> 22:57.499
Manager Jang, cover for me.

22:57.499 --> 22:59.067
[Manager Jang Moon Ho]
Spin a story.

22:59.067 --> 23:01.069
I was never there.

23:05.553 --> 23:07.009
What happened here?

23:07.009 --> 23:09.024
Well,

23:09.024 --> 23:12.849
the motor sounded off,
so I sent it to the shop.

23:12.849 --> 23:14.416
You said the swap was done.

23:14.416 --> 23:16.018
The Chairman's safety is on the line,

23:16.018 --> 23:17.943
so I wanted to be sure.

23:17.943 --> 23:20.490
Should I bring another car?

23:20.490 --> 23:21.963
Don't bother.

23:23.192 --> 23:26.628
Driving on a night like this always ends bad.

23:35.057 --> 23:36.967
K League leaders Choiseong FC

23:36.967 --> 23:40.375
[Hwang Jun Hyeon]
announced today they signed Hwang Jun Hyeon.

23:40.375 --> 23:43.867
After three years with FC Sunyang,
Hwang Jun Hyeon

23:43.867 --> 23:48.001
started 31 matches with 13 goals and 9 assists,

23:48.001 --> 23:50.485
winning K League 2 MVP.

23:50.485 --> 23:53.801
["I Will Make Choiseong FC Champions."]
After a fierce bidding war,

23:53.801 --> 23:56.997
his move to Choiseong FC is now official.

23:56.997 --> 24:00.362
- With huge appeal and outstanding...
- That's my grandson.

24:01.500 --> 24:04.333
Congratulations.

24:04.333 --> 24:06.101
There he is.

24:07.234 --> 24:08.803
Grandma!

24:10.967 --> 24:12.943
That's not him.

24:12.943 --> 24:15.377
My grandson Jun Hyeon

24:15.377 --> 24:18.113
is the soccer player Hwang Jun Hyeon.

24:19.047 --> 24:20.178
Look, see?

24:20.178 --> 24:22.084
Grandma.

24:22.084 --> 24:23.452
I'm your grandson, right?

24:23.452 --> 24:27.856
Choiseong FC, number 77,
striker Hwang Jun Hyeon!

24:27.856 --> 24:29.067
There you are!

24:29.067 --> 24:30.692
My grandson!

24:30.692 --> 24:32.427
The turf is unreal,

24:32.427 --> 24:33.994
and the jersey feels like silk.

24:33.994 --> 24:36.633
She's sharp the moment soccer comes up.

24:36.633 --> 24:39.801
Who'd ever guess Ok Sun has dementia?

24:39.801 --> 24:41.653
Just like you wished,

24:41.653 --> 24:43.693
I'll make it to the Premier League.

24:43.693 --> 24:45.974
The hard days are over.

24:52.034 --> 24:54.451
Why is there no sound?

24:54.451 --> 24:56.453
Can you see what it is?

24:56.453 --> 24:59.587
Father's gone, just drive to the track.

25:04.427 --> 25:06.141
Looks like overseas accounts.

25:06.141 --> 25:07.621
Where? Where exactly?

25:07.621 --> 25:09.041
- Quit it!
- Let me see!

25:09.041 --> 25:10.899
Just drive!

25:14.567 --> 25:17.372
I got your favorite chocolate cake too.

25:30.734 --> 25:32.821
What was that?

26:21.770 --> 26:24.206
Jun Hyeon.

26:24.206 --> 26:26.108
Answer me,

26:26.108 --> 26:28.134
say something,

26:28.134 --> 26:30.411
please, answer me.

26:39.534 --> 26:41.123
Male, twenties, traffic accident,

26:41.123 --> 26:42.624
unconscious, no BP reading.

26:42.624 --> 26:44.134
Family? Any family?

26:44.134 --> 26:46.254
He only has his grandmother,

26:46.254 --> 26:48.461
and she has dementia. What do we do?

26:48.461 --> 26:51.367
[Caregiver Auntie]
Suspected internal bleeding and leg fracture.

26:51.367 --> 26:53.168
Are you hurt?

26:53.168 --> 26:56.101
A cat darted out of nowhere,

26:56.101 --> 26:57.973
so I clipped the rail.

26:57.973 --> 27:01.543
Manager Jang, Father can never know.

27:01.543 --> 27:03.411
Are we clear?

27:04.746 --> 27:07.162
Police cams, road footage, dashcams,

27:07.162 --> 27:09.322
every witness, wipe it all.

27:09.322 --> 27:11.753
Clean it up before sunrise.

27:15.798 --> 27:17.959
The track's cameras are wiped,

27:17.959 --> 27:20.801
and the gate staff are silenced.

27:20.801 --> 27:22.097
Let's prep for emergency surgery.

27:22.097 --> 27:24.134
Right away.

27:24.134 --> 27:25.900
Hello?

27:27.134 --> 27:28.634
Yes.

27:28.634 --> 27:30.371
Understood.

27:34.442 --> 27:35.638
[Delete selected CCTV file?]
[Delete]

27:38.231 --> 27:39.247
[Delete]

27:39.247 --> 27:40.417
[Deletion complete]

27:40.417 --> 27:41.669
[Main OR]

28:17.034 --> 28:18.234
Good morning.

28:18.234 --> 28:19.934
Good morning.

28:19.934 --> 28:21.756
Good morning.

28:26.300 --> 28:28.263
The battery is fully swapped.

28:28.263 --> 28:31.499
One spin and you'll feel the difference.

28:52.554 --> 28:55.025
You patched the wrong spot.

28:55.025 --> 28:57.192
Did the kids drop by last night?

28:57.192 --> 28:58.500
No, sir.

28:58.500 --> 29:01.229
No, nothing like that.

29:23.983 --> 29:25.787
Please forgive me.

29:25.787 --> 29:29.059
Jae Seong said he swerved
for a cat and hit the rail,

29:29.059 --> 29:30.559
and nobody was hurt.

29:30.559 --> 29:33.761
He and Jae Gyeong ordered strict silence.

29:35.801 --> 29:38.696
The accident footage is wiped clean, right?

29:38.696 --> 29:40.317
When have I ever botched anything?

29:40.317 --> 29:43.356
Nothing botched,
so how did Father catch the slush funds?

29:43.356 --> 29:45.075
We don't know that.

29:45.075 --> 29:48.345
If Father knew, would he leave us alone?

29:48.345 --> 29:52.115
That document might not be a slush fund tip.

29:54.649 --> 29:56.384
It's coming to us anyway,

29:56.384 --> 29:58.286
so what's the harm in taking some early?

29:58.286 --> 30:00.634
It cuts the tax bill, that's all.

30:00.634 --> 30:02.591
At other groups, the chairman steps up

30:02.591 --> 30:04.071
and sets the slush funds up himself,

30:04.071 --> 30:06.795
handling the inheritance well in advance.

30:06.795 --> 30:09.099
My friends are all chairmen already.

30:09.099 --> 30:12.069
The old man is just greedy.

30:13.218 --> 30:15.787
Is he planning to keep it all?

30:16.471 --> 30:17.778
What?

30:17.778 --> 30:21.034
He's been two steps
ahead of us this whole time,

30:21.034 --> 30:23.146
using that slush fund like a leash,

30:23.146 --> 30:25.547
squeezing more out of us.

30:25.547 --> 30:27.382
Is King Yeongjo his idol?

30:27.382 --> 30:28.700
Yanking us around

30:28.700 --> 30:32.120
just to torture us? He's losing it.

30:33.421 --> 30:36.660
We'll never measure up in Dad's eyes.

30:36.660 --> 30:39.667
Even with the chairman's seat,

30:39.667 --> 30:42.969
we'd still be tiptoeing around him,

30:42.969 --> 30:47.935
bowing for whatever crumbs he drops.

30:48.939 --> 30:52.509
What a miserable life.

30:52.509 --> 30:53.908
That kid.

30:55.067 --> 30:56.844
Did he survive?

31:52.498 --> 31:55.338
You're awake, Mr. Hwang.

31:55.338 --> 31:57.171
How are you feeling?

31:58.934 --> 32:01.178
The surgery went well,

32:01.178 --> 32:03.798
and daily life won't be a problem.

32:03.798 --> 32:06.626
But with multiple ligament tears,

32:06.626 --> 32:07.901
including the PCL,

32:07.901 --> 32:09.718
and the leg fracture,

32:09.718 --> 32:12.718
rehab won't be easy.

32:12.718 --> 32:14.459
I'm sorry to say...

32:14.459 --> 32:16.467
soccer

32:16.467 --> 32:18.426
is off the table.

32:22.299 --> 32:23.747
What?

32:26.901 --> 32:29.170
What are you saying?

32:30.158 --> 32:31.973
You said the surgery went well.

32:31.973 --> 32:34.134
We did everything we could.

32:34.134 --> 32:35.810
I'm sorry.

32:38.834 --> 32:41.516
No, no, Doctor.

32:42.163 --> 32:44.652
You want to know what trying everything means?

32:46.134 --> 32:48.123
[Strict Bed Rest]
For over fifteen years, no days off,

32:48.123 --> 32:50.992
I trained at five every morning.

32:55.428 --> 32:58.099
She forgets her own name,

33:03.567 --> 33:05.834
but never that her grandson plays soccer.

33:05.834 --> 33:08.509
For my grandma's sake,

33:10.300 --> 33:13.681
I never even said it was hard.

33:16.217 --> 33:17.652
I'll play again.

33:17.652 --> 33:19.987
I have to, no matter what.

33:21.268 --> 33:23.224
So please,

33:24.034 --> 33:27.795
just fix my leg.

33:30.767 --> 33:33.501
I'm begging you.

33:43.335 --> 33:45.263
With the slush fund confirmed,

33:45.263 --> 33:47.884
[Internal Special Audit Report: Choiseong Group]
handing things over is too soon.

33:47.884 --> 33:50.518
I'm sure this rattles you too.

33:51.135 --> 33:54.021
You've seen how low they sink.

33:58.134 --> 33:59.827
Bury it.

34:01.429 --> 34:03.130
The slush fund.

34:03.900 --> 34:06.000
Every related document,

34:07.333 --> 34:09.567
destroy it for good.

34:09.567 --> 34:11.534
And keep the staff quiet.

34:11.534 --> 34:13.308
This isn't a small amount, Sir.

34:13.308 --> 34:16.633
- If you keep cleaning up after them...
- Those brats.

34:16.633 --> 34:19.814
Looks like they hit my dashcam last night.

34:20.848 --> 34:24.418
And still you'll bury it?

34:26.034 --> 34:28.523
They've lived under my thumb their whole lives.

34:28.523 --> 34:32.796
Whoever takes over, I need to back them.

34:32.796 --> 34:36.299
I can't keep crushing them.

34:36.299 --> 34:37.934
Too scared of their father

34:37.934 --> 34:41.902
to do anything. I won't raise fools.

34:45.034 --> 34:46.974
Understood.

34:47.834 --> 34:49.177
Grab the files.

34:49.177 --> 34:50.296
[Special Audit Report: Corporate Slush Funds]

35:26.714 --> 35:29.550
This is the real estate
I set aside for my wife.

35:29.550 --> 35:33.554
Sell it and book it
as Trading and Chemicals revenue.

35:33.554 --> 35:36.542
Before anyone catches wind and points fingers.

35:36.542 --> 35:38.362
Yes.

35:38.362 --> 35:41.101
Then the succession announcement
proceeds as planned.

35:41.101 --> 35:43.064
I'll prepare for it.

35:46.400 --> 35:48.801
Money doesn't change much.

35:48.801 --> 35:51.539
Every parent's guilty in the end.

35:54.734 --> 35:57.345
You can't keep doing this.

35:58.300 --> 35:59.829
Don't pull on that.

35:59.829 --> 36:01.449
Settle down.

36:01.449 --> 36:03.968
[I can make a comeback. Please, just trust me]

36:05.553 --> 36:06.929
[Coach, Choiseong FC]

36:09.700 --> 36:14.128
The number's unavailable. After the tone...

36:21.636 --> 36:23.562
[Caregiver Auntie]

36:28.843 --> 36:30.484
[An overdue interest payment
of 2 million won has been detected]

36:45.495 --> 36:46.934
Grab the bar.

36:46.934 --> 36:48.565
Hold the bar.

36:48.565 --> 36:50.295
You okay?

37:21.594 --> 37:23.697
Sir, I'm here.

37:27.497 --> 37:29.309
It's been a while.

37:29.309 --> 37:32.295
Whenever something big came up,
we'd start the morning here.

37:32.295 --> 37:34.909
Son or grandson takes it over,

37:34.909 --> 37:36.780
the broth tastes the same.

37:36.780 --> 37:39.414
So does the kkakdugi.

37:39.414 --> 37:44.054
Took me this long
to see how big a deal that is.

37:44.054 --> 37:46.636
Don't end up with regrets like mine.

37:46.636 --> 37:48.258
Put the work into raising your kids.

37:48.258 --> 37:50.667
I was planning to.

37:50.667 --> 37:53.396
When you step down, I'm out too.

37:53.396 --> 37:56.197
So that's why you pushed me to stay?

37:56.197 --> 37:57.398
Missing the paycheck already?

37:57.398 --> 37:59.233
Just figured it out?

38:07.433 --> 38:09.844
Who you'll hand it to,

38:11.001 --> 38:13.047
have you decided?

38:14.551 --> 38:16.501
I have to.

38:18.689 --> 38:20.423
Whoever...

38:20.423 --> 38:23.647
protects Choiseong the most.

38:50.587 --> 38:52.373
325 yeo...

38:55.456 --> 38:58.012
[325 yeo 20]

39:00.061 --> 39:01.075
[325 yeo 20]

39:02.396 --> 39:03.396
[325 yeo 20]

39:10.301 --> 39:12.540
I saw the plate clear as day.

39:12.540 --> 39:15.776
325 yeo 20.

39:15.776 --> 39:18.546
325 yeo 20.

39:20.534 --> 39:22.001
The rest is a blank.

39:22.001 --> 39:24.051
That's only a hundred combos left.

39:24.051 --> 39:26.067
A search will find it.

39:26.067 --> 39:28.134
There was a strange emblem
on the back bumper too.

39:28.134 --> 39:29.893
What about proof?

39:29.893 --> 39:32.693
A photo or video of the plate?

39:32.693 --> 39:35.667
The street cams would've caught it.

39:35.667 --> 39:37.665
That spot's a blind spot,

39:37.665 --> 39:40.535
and the backup recorder was down that day.

39:40.535 --> 39:42.837
There's nothing on file.

39:42.837 --> 39:45.542
I can't open a case based on memory alone.

39:53.254 --> 39:55.849
No evidence found from the victim.

39:58.934 --> 40:00.288
I'm done here.

40:00.288 --> 40:02.225
What about Choiseong FC?

40:02.225 --> 40:03.881
How did it go?

40:05.876 --> 40:07.428
A penalty fee?

40:07.428 --> 40:09.964
I gave back every won of the signing bonus!

40:09.964 --> 40:11.567
[General Manager Han Jae Kwon]

40:11.567 --> 40:14.234
There's the transfer fee we paid for you.

40:14.234 --> 40:16.467
Choiseong FC took a big hit too.

40:16.467 --> 40:20.007
I hate to say it, but the contract's off.

40:20.853 --> 40:22.977
Sir.

40:22.977 --> 40:24.667
I can rehab through this.

40:24.667 --> 40:26.854
Watch me. I'll prove I can come back.

40:26.854 --> 40:28.816
So please...

40:30.320 --> 40:32.938
Just give me one shot.

40:32.938 --> 40:35.151
Morale's at rock bottom.

40:35.151 --> 40:38.759
Fact is, you set the team back.

40:38.759 --> 40:40.512
But a billion won in penalties?

40:40.512 --> 40:42.934
That's just cruel.

40:42.934 --> 40:44.632
The call came from upstairs.

40:44.632 --> 40:46.800
Our hands are tied.

40:47.871 --> 40:50.874
He's buried in debt he can't dig out of.

40:50.874 --> 40:53.040
That'll keep him in line.

40:53.040 --> 40:58.371
[Seeking Witnesses to Traffic Accident]

41:22.837 --> 41:25.467
[Caregiver Auntie]

41:25.467 --> 41:26.767
Hello?

41:26.767 --> 41:28.363
Why haven't you picked up?

41:28.363 --> 41:30.244
I've been worried sick.

41:31.114 --> 41:33.201
Auntie.

41:33.201 --> 41:34.898
You've been through hell.

41:34.898 --> 41:37.084
It's all going to be okay.

41:39.020 --> 41:40.857
Nothing's okay.

41:40.857 --> 41:43.258
They say there's no evidence.

41:43.258 --> 41:44.692
What do you mean, no evidence?

41:44.692 --> 41:46.927
Did you not get what I sent?

41:48.201 --> 41:50.197
So Grandma has something to watch,

41:50.197 --> 41:52.733
I record every video call.

41:58.005 --> 41:59.901
[325 yeo 2058]

41:59.901 --> 42:02.943
325 yeo 2058.

42:04.512 --> 42:05.546
[License Plate Lookup]

42:05.546 --> 42:06.546
[Full Vehicle History]

42:07.534 --> 42:09.419
[325 yeo 2058]

42:09.419 --> 42:10.851
[Search Third-Party Vehicle]

42:10.851 --> 42:11.686
[325 yeo 2058]

42:11.686 --> 42:13.210
[Maserati MC 20 Cielo]

42:18.059 --> 42:20.069
[Only Ten of These Electric
Supercars Worldwide]

42:21.529 --> 42:26.934
[Speed Junkie!
Chairman Kang Lands a Supercar]

42:30.237 --> 42:32.801
[F1 fan Chairman Kang unwinds
with stacks of F1 magazines]

42:33.534 --> 42:35.776
Happiness, my foot.

42:48.122 --> 42:49.395
[Chairman Kang Yong Ho]

42:57.365 --> 42:58.401
[To: Chairman Kang, From: F1 Magazine]

42:58.401 --> 43:00.295
This month's issue already arrived.

43:00.295 --> 43:01.534
It's a special edition.

43:01.534 --> 43:04.171
He ordered it. Rush delivery.

43:05.343 --> 43:07.400
Send it up to the Chairman's office.

43:07.400 --> 43:10.368
[Special Edition Inside]

43:30.567 --> 43:33.547
Want to see what happens next? Call me.

43:33.547 --> 43:36.336
Owner of 325 yeo 2058.

43:46.801 --> 43:50.217
The Chairman wants you upstairs.

44:05.717 --> 44:08.134
Hwang Jun Hyeon.

44:08.134 --> 44:10.771
That was a bold little stunt.

44:11.437 --> 44:14.775
I don't take being wronged lying down.

44:15.976 --> 44:17.978
Wronged, huh.

44:20.448 --> 44:24.451
Let's see if you can keep
a straight face after this.

44:40.658 --> 44:42.201
Please forgive me.

44:42.201 --> 44:45.272
Jae Seong said he swerved
for a cat and hit the rail.

44:45.272 --> 44:48.742
He and Jae Gyeong ordered strict silence.

44:48.742 --> 44:52.546
Because of you, my soccer career is over.

44:52.546 --> 44:56.383
I was thrilled to join Choiseong FC!

44:57.017 --> 44:59.353
Cutting my contract, slapping me with fines.

44:59.353 --> 45:02.083
You thought I'd run scared?

45:02.083 --> 45:03.867
Faking evidence, buying off cops,

45:03.867 --> 45:06.593
you really thought that would bury the truth?

45:16.886 --> 45:19.006
So how much do you want?

45:22.101 --> 45:24.978
A decent person starts
with an apology, don't they?

45:28.634 --> 45:31.318
For me, an apology is money.

45:31.952 --> 45:36.259
Nothing says sorry deeper than a check.

45:36.259 --> 45:38.826
You'll be better off with it.

45:38.826 --> 45:40.761
What about my life?

45:41.386 --> 45:44.331
You ruin a life and think cash fixes it?

45:46.359 --> 45:48.936
Hwang Jun Hyeon's career file

45:49.546 --> 45:52.801
and the Choiseong FC contract, bring them.

45:52.801 --> 45:55.109
Right away, Sir.

45:55.109 --> 45:56.577
[From Rookie of the Year to MVP:
The Rise of Hwang Jun Hyeon]

45:56.577 --> 45:58.095
[Professional Soccer Player Contract]

45:59.367 --> 46:01.849
Signed a month ago for 500 million.

46:01.849 --> 46:05.067
On the national team, knocked down by injury,

46:05.067 --> 46:07.693
looks like you've had it rough.

46:07.693 --> 46:11.024
What do you think you're worth?

46:11.970 --> 46:15.596
A soccer career usually lasts

46:15.596 --> 46:17.734
till the mid-thirties.

46:17.734 --> 46:19.891
Another decade for you?

46:19.891 --> 46:21.602
Where are you going with this?

46:21.602 --> 46:25.001
Even if luck spared you at Choiseong FC

46:25.001 --> 46:27.344
and you played injury-free,

46:27.344 --> 46:30.077
your top salary tops out at 5 billion won.

46:32.063 --> 46:34.067
That sum,

46:34.067 --> 46:35.716
I'll pay it.

46:36.503 --> 46:38.772
And the penalty fees? Gone.

46:39.999 --> 46:43.994
That's enough to start over, whatever you do.

46:43.994 --> 46:45.625
In exchange,

46:46.560 --> 46:48.762
hand over the video.

46:52.534 --> 46:53.737
And if I refuse?

46:53.737 --> 46:57.438
Stop running on emotion. Think.

46:57.438 --> 46:59.049
Even if you walk into a police station,

46:59.049 --> 47:02.142
push the video at them, and press charges,

47:02.142 --> 47:05.834
I take a little heat, hit the news a few times,

47:05.834 --> 47:09.116
step down briefly, and it's done.

47:10.013 --> 47:12.519
You'd trade a windfall for that?

47:14.388 --> 47:17.853
The world always bends your way. Fun for you?

47:17.853 --> 47:20.594
Who are you to write off my future?

47:20.594 --> 47:22.801
A few sheets of paper with my history,

47:22.801 --> 47:26.133
is my life so pathetic
you can price it in minutes?

47:26.133 --> 47:27.674
Whether I'm the next Messi or Son Heung Min,

47:27.674 --> 47:30.170
who made you the judge?

47:30.170 --> 47:31.905
Because you can't.

47:32.700 --> 47:36.710
A kid who hears "no hope"
and runs in chasing a payout?

47:37.581 --> 47:39.327
What does he become?

47:40.147 --> 47:41.849
What if I sue?

47:41.849 --> 47:43.813
Fight to the end, prove the hit-and-run,

47:43.813 --> 47:46.486
bring Choiseong down. What then?

47:49.734 --> 47:53.027
You think my Choiseong falls that easy?

47:53.027 --> 47:55.128
To someone like you?

48:00.734 --> 48:03.837
Soccer was my whole life too.

48:05.272 --> 48:08.653
More than Choiseong ever was to you.

48:08.653 --> 48:11.714
Me reaching the Premier League,
that's my grandma's dream.

48:11.714 --> 48:13.926
All the pain I put her through,

48:13.926 --> 48:17.896
every drop of sweat I left on that field,
can you price that?

48:19.268 --> 48:20.787
You'll get it.

48:21.522 --> 48:24.024
Whatever amount you want.

48:29.866 --> 48:31.143
[Blank Check]

48:32.599 --> 48:35.400
[Issuer: Kang Yong Ho]
Want ten billion? Write ten billion.

48:35.400 --> 48:36.937
I'm curious too.

48:36.937 --> 48:39.209
For that grand life of yours,

48:39.209 --> 48:41.908
what number you'll land on.

48:51.201 --> 48:55.097
Sir, the Presidents are here.

48:55.097 --> 48:58.101
If you decide to bury this here,

48:58.101 --> 48:59.893
come back and see me.

49:01.034 --> 49:03.230
No more negotiating.

49:14.225 --> 49:15.266
Because you can't.

49:15.266 --> 49:19.500
A kid who hears "no hope"
and runs in chasing a payout?

49:19.500 --> 49:21.215
What does he become?

49:21.215 --> 49:22.226
You'll get it.

49:22.226 --> 49:24.618
Whatever amount you want.

49:27.333 --> 49:30.126
I'm sorry.

49:30.126 --> 49:32.192
- Who's this punk?
- Doors closing.

49:43.067 --> 49:45.172
5 billion won...

49:45.789 --> 49:49.336
I can put Grandma in a better place.

49:49.336 --> 49:52.703
That clears every debt we have.

49:52.703 --> 49:56.015
I can do anything with that.

49:56.015 --> 49:58.018
With that...

50:01.963 --> 50:03.493
I'm curious too.

50:03.493 --> 50:05.738
For that grand life of yours,

50:05.738 --> 50:08.428
what number you'll land on.

50:09.563 --> 50:12.152
[Blank Check]

50:20.140 --> 50:21.660
[Grandma]

50:30.201 --> 50:32.118
Jun Hyeon.

50:33.757 --> 50:35.206
Grandma.

50:35.206 --> 50:37.894
She's done with the gown.

50:37.894 --> 50:40.493
She wants out so she can hit the stadium.

50:40.493 --> 50:41.895
Ok Sun, come on.

50:41.895 --> 50:42.906
Look.

50:42.906 --> 50:45.034
I can eat just fine on my own.

50:56.410 --> 50:58.201
Ok Sun.

50:58.201 --> 51:00.369
What team does Jun Hyeon play for?

51:00.369 --> 51:01.415
Choiseong FC.

51:01.415 --> 51:03.333
That's right!

51:03.333 --> 51:04.510
Nicely done.

51:04.510 --> 51:07.788
So what's his number?

51:07.788 --> 51:12.067
Lucky seven, seven. Number 77.

51:12.067 --> 51:14.150
And his position?

51:14.150 --> 51:16.796
Striker!

51:18.198 --> 51:20.510
Your grandma's a genius.

51:20.510 --> 51:23.937
Auntie, I'll call you back later.

51:35.334 --> 51:37.617
Go get them, my boy!

51:40.967 --> 51:43.556
Grandma, I'm sorry.

51:45.114 --> 51:47.861
They say soccer's over for me.

51:51.500 --> 51:54.467
I broke our promise.

51:55.700 --> 51:58.538
What do I do now?

52:03.600 --> 52:05.234
Attention, please.

52:05.234 --> 52:08.548
The Chairman's board meeting starts shortly,

52:08.548 --> 52:10.384
so all listed executives,

52:10.384 --> 52:14.090
please gather in the third-floor boardroom.

52:14.090 --> 52:15.589
Attention, please.

52:15.589 --> 52:18.859
The Chairman's board meeting starts shortly,

52:18.859 --> 52:20.727
so all listed executives,

52:20.727 --> 52:24.631
please gather in the third-floor boardroom.

52:46.353 --> 52:47.956
I'm sorry, Dad.

52:47.956 --> 52:50.896
Jae Seong was driving.

52:50.896 --> 52:53.983
All I did was clean it up.

52:53.983 --> 52:56.563
Jae Gyeong's the one who whispered to run.

52:56.563 --> 52:59.268
If she hadn't lost it over the dashcam,

52:59.268 --> 53:01.835
there'd be no accident. I swear.

53:04.168 --> 53:05.238
One.

53:05.238 --> 53:07.500
Letting Strategic Planning
catch the slush fund.

53:07.500 --> 53:10.077
Sloppy work on your part.

53:10.077 --> 53:11.433
Two.

53:11.433 --> 53:12.970
Digging into me without fear,

53:12.970 --> 53:15.858
then wrecking my prized car.

53:15.858 --> 53:17.478
Three.

53:17.478 --> 53:19.333
Botching the cleanup

53:19.333 --> 53:22.456
and smearing my name!

53:22.456 --> 53:26.244
Neither of you can run Choiseong.

53:26.244 --> 53:28.595
Forget about the Chairman's chair.

53:28.595 --> 53:30.934
I'll announce it at the board.

53:30.934 --> 53:32.875
You two,

53:33.703 --> 53:36.539
get ready to step down.

53:39.734 --> 53:41.044
Dad!

53:41.044 --> 53:42.709
Dad!

53:46.554 --> 53:48.634
Close the door already.

53:48.634 --> 53:49.943
Dad!

53:51.321 --> 53:52.806
Damn it.

53:53.534 --> 53:54.674
The stairs!

53:54.674 --> 53:56.623
- Stairs!
- Stairs.

53:57.591 --> 53:58.658
It's him!

53:58.658 --> 54:00.460
The young guy from the Chairman's office!

54:00.460 --> 54:01.495
That Hwang guy...

54:01.495 --> 54:03.415
How did he find us here?

54:03.415 --> 54:05.098
You said you wiped it all!

54:05.098 --> 54:06.767
How could you mess up the job like this?

54:06.767 --> 54:09.268
Fact is, you were driving when it happened!

54:09.268 --> 54:12.934
If I get fired as President, you're dead.

54:12.934 --> 54:14.677
Like I'm going down alone?

54:14.677 --> 54:15.878
Hey, hold up.

54:15.878 --> 54:16.901
- Hold up.
- Come on.

54:16.901 --> 54:18.767
- Hold up.
- Like I'll stop for you!

54:18.767 --> 54:20.553
- Seriously.
- Hurry.

54:36.066 --> 54:37.813
- Stop!
- Stop!

54:43.573 --> 54:45.851
Dad!

54:50.710 --> 54:51.767
Sir!

54:51.767 --> 54:53.513
Dad!

55:35.546 --> 55:36.565
What?

55:36.565 --> 55:39.034
Why's it so loud?

55:39.034 --> 55:41.600
Sang Jae...

55:41.600 --> 55:43.696
Where did he go?

55:45.402 --> 55:47.103
My leg...

55:47.901 --> 55:50.136
My leg is moving.

55:52.333 --> 55:53.985
What?

55:53.985 --> 55:55.675
Am I dreaming?

55:57.901 --> 55:59.073
What?

55:59.073 --> 56:01.451
A hospital?

56:01.451 --> 56:03.252
What is this?

56:11.134 --> 56:13.126
Straight to resuscitation.

56:35.500 --> 56:36.983
Mr. Hwang.

56:37.901 --> 56:39.422
Are you awake?

56:39.422 --> 56:41.333
Hey, you.

56:41.333 --> 56:43.193
Who am I to you right now?

56:43.193 --> 56:45.184
You look like Hwang Jun Hyeon.

56:45.184 --> 56:46.200
That's right, isn't it?

56:46.200 --> 56:47.961
Of all people,

56:47.961 --> 56:50.063
why am I that kid?

56:50.063 --> 56:52.734
You've been out a day. You need rest.

56:52.734 --> 56:54.500
Hold on.

56:56.175 --> 56:57.204
How many fingers?

56:57.204 --> 56:59.500
Forget that.

56:59.500 --> 57:00.907
Where...

57:00.907 --> 57:03.180
Where is the real me?

57:03.180 --> 57:04.439
Well...

57:04.439 --> 57:06.901
Set up another brain CT for Mr. Hwang.

57:06.901 --> 57:07.967
Got it.

57:07.967 --> 57:10.717
No, that's not what I mean...

57:13.136 --> 57:14.139
This place...

57:14.139 --> 57:15.339
Which hospital is this?

57:15.339 --> 57:17.190
This is Hangang University Hospital.

57:17.190 --> 57:18.867
First we need a scan of your head...

57:18.867 --> 57:21.014
Seriously!

57:21.014 --> 57:22.019
Mr. Hwang.

57:22.019 --> 57:23.763
Why is this working?

57:23.763 --> 57:25.502
Mr. Hwang.

57:28.834 --> 57:31.237
Looks like a temporary shock.

57:32.477 --> 57:35.648
Then why isn't he waking up?

57:38.600 --> 57:39.834
He's just sleeping.

57:39.834 --> 57:41.945
The MRI came back clean,

57:41.945 --> 57:43.787
so there's nothing to worry about.

57:43.787 --> 57:46.052
He's always been so healthy.

57:46.052 --> 57:49.793
Just to be safe, run more tests.

57:49.793 --> 57:52.626
That sudden succession call,

57:52.626 --> 57:54.231
it bothers me.

57:54.231 --> 57:56.499
This is so annoying.

57:57.330 --> 57:59.109
Why should a stay-at-home wife

57:59.109 --> 58:01.862
care who runs the company?

58:01.862 --> 58:03.001
Jae Gyeong,

58:03.001 --> 58:05.651
I'm just worried about him.

58:05.651 --> 58:07.224
Right,

58:07.224 --> 58:09.615
just worry, then.

58:09.615 --> 58:12.278
You've always stuck to that.

58:13.947 --> 58:15.915
Please don't worry.

58:15.915 --> 58:18.285
He'll wake up soon.

58:18.285 --> 58:19.541
Of course.

58:19.541 --> 58:21.120
He has to.

58:32.805 --> 58:34.871
Before the accident,

58:34.871 --> 58:37.438
did something happen?

58:37.438 --> 58:39.272
You came running,

58:39.272 --> 58:41.268
trying to stop him,

58:41.268 --> 58:43.552
shouting "Stop."

58:43.552 --> 58:45.861
Stop what?

58:45.861 --> 58:46.866
No, we didn't.

58:46.866 --> 58:48.515
- Stop!
- Stop!

58:48.515 --> 58:50.383
When did we do that?

58:56.500 --> 58:58.291
That guy who fell with him?

58:58.291 --> 58:59.559
No clue.

58:59.559 --> 59:02.252
But it wasn't a fall.

59:02.252 --> 59:03.700
Didn't he shove him?

59:03.700 --> 59:05.201
Watch your mouth.

59:05.201 --> 59:07.273
The intranet's blowing up,

59:07.273 --> 59:10.006
saying he headbutted the guy and went down.

59:10.006 --> 59:13.943
There's history with that man for sure.

59:14.600 --> 59:16.746
What's gotten into him?

59:16.746 --> 59:20.533
Out of nowhere, succession and now this.

59:20.533 --> 59:22.700
Never a scandal in his life,

59:22.700 --> 59:25.518
so maybe it's really time.

59:28.433 --> 59:30.333
Ears everywhere.

59:30.333 --> 59:34.494
The company's in crisis, so zip it.

59:34.494 --> 59:35.626
Right.

59:35.626 --> 59:37.434
How's the Chairman?

59:37.434 --> 59:39.335
Any sign he'll wake up?

59:46.973 --> 59:48.464
[BREAKING:
Choiseong's Kang linked to hit-and-run]

59:50.944 --> 59:52.045
[BREAKING:
Kang's car in hit-and-run; assault tip filed]

59:52.045 --> 59:54.101
- What?
- What is this?

59:54.101 --> 59:55.648
We have breaking news.

59:55.648 --> 59:58.300
The recent hit-and-run by the Choiseong Circuit

59:58.300 --> 01:00:00.987
has been tied to a vehicle owned

01:00:00.987 --> 01:00:04.057
by Chairman Kang Yong Ho, shocking the public.

01:00:04.057 --> 01:00:07.293
An anonymous tip claims he verbally

01:00:07.293 --> 01:00:09.934
and physically abused the victim,

01:00:09.934 --> 01:00:12.132
with major fallout expected.

01:00:12.132 --> 01:00:14.667
The victim is now being treated

01:00:14.667 --> 01:00:16.700
at an undisclosed Seoul hospital.

01:00:16.700 --> 01:00:19.239
Some witnesses say Chairman Kang

01:00:19.239 --> 01:00:22.342
charged at the victim first.

01:00:22.342 --> 01:00:25.712
His exact condition and what really happened

01:00:25.712 --> 01:00:27.268
remain unconfirmed.

01:00:27.268 --> 01:00:29.452
I don't take being wronged lying down.

01:00:29.452 --> 01:00:31.414
Wronged, huh.

01:00:32.267 --> 01:00:34.101
Faking evidence, buying off cops,

01:00:34.101 --> 01:00:36.789
you really thought that would bury the truth?

01:00:40.764 --> 01:00:42.632
Secrets are leaking.

01:00:42.632 --> 01:00:45.031
Check if the victim's awake,

01:00:45.031 --> 01:00:46.199
and secure him first.

01:00:46.199 --> 01:00:47.834
Yes, on it.

01:00:53.700 --> 01:00:56.409
The Chairman, a hit-and-run?

01:00:56.409 --> 01:00:58.878
Do you two know anything?

01:00:59.879 --> 01:01:02.658
This caught us off guard too.

01:01:02.658 --> 01:01:05.618
Before the board meeting,

01:01:05.618 --> 01:01:08.478
he pulled us aside and gave us a hint.

01:01:08.478 --> 01:01:10.794
All I did was clean it up.

01:01:10.794 --> 01:01:13.142
I had no idea about the hit-and-run.

01:01:17.667 --> 01:01:19.317
That's right.

01:01:19.317 --> 01:01:21.938
He'd been silencing the victim all along.

01:01:21.938 --> 01:01:24.769
If she hadn't lost it over the dashcam,

01:01:24.769 --> 01:01:25.938
there'd be no accident. I swear.

01:01:25.938 --> 01:01:27.201
Afraid it would all come out,

01:01:27.201 --> 01:01:29.478
he rushed the succession.

01:01:29.478 --> 01:01:33.316
So the Chairman actually

01:01:33.316 --> 01:01:36.215
admitted the hit-and-run to you both?

01:01:39.534 --> 01:01:41.134
Dad!

01:01:41.134 --> 01:01:44.690
Please tell us the truth.

01:01:45.767 --> 01:01:46.993
Yes,

01:01:46.993 --> 01:01:51.097
he caused the accident.

01:01:58.600 --> 01:02:01.746
Like hell he did!

01:02:01.746 --> 01:02:04.543
You damn bastards!

01:02:20.367 --> 01:02:21.901
Who are you?

01:02:21.901 --> 01:02:23.900
Move aside.

01:02:23.900 --> 01:02:26.165
I'm getting my body back.

01:02:49.700 --> 01:02:51.123
Honey.

01:02:52.001 --> 01:02:53.693
Honey.

01:03:34.034 --> 01:03:35.529
Know who I am?

01:03:35.529 --> 01:03:38.071
Was that punk trying to headbutt Father?

01:03:38.071 --> 01:03:38.849
Dad.

01:03:38.849 --> 01:03:41.349
Prepare for the worst.

01:03:41.349 --> 01:03:44.248
[Stop the cover-up, pay up!]
Your career's done, so take the payout.

01:03:44.248 --> 01:03:46.009
You're getting whatever you want.

01:03:46.009 --> 01:03:47.769
The hit-and-run's been buried.

01:03:47.769 --> 01:03:49.469
You'd better see this through for me.

01:03:49.469 --> 01:03:51.999
I'm Hwang Jun Hyeon, intern at Choiseong.

01:03:51.999 --> 01:03:54.579
Looking forward to working with you.

01:03:54.579 --> 01:03:56.522
So this is Materials Team 2.

01:03:56.522 --> 01:03:58.992
Does he report to you?
Who are you, the Chairman?

01:03:58.992 --> 01:04:00.226
Me!

01:04:00.226 --> 01:04:01.366
We call her Yes Kang.

01:04:01.366 --> 01:04:02.086
I'll handle it.

01:04:02.086 --> 01:04:03.486
She's our team's gem.

01:04:03.486 --> 01:04:05.706
If you tell anyone
I'm the Chairman's daughter, you're dead.

01:04:05.706 --> 01:04:08.465
About Casey...

01:04:08.465 --> 01:04:10.503
The Chairman's awake?

01:04:10.503 --> 01:04:12.342
[Copying files]
Father said that? That we did it?

01:04:12.342 --> 01:04:13.634
Got proof?

01:04:13.634 --> 01:04:14.686
Here to steal something?

01:04:14.686 --> 01:04:15.667
Call the cops!

01:04:15.667 --> 01:04:17.666
Don't let him out of here.

01:04:17.666 --> 01:04:21.313
[Choiseong Emergency Press Conference]
The real culprit who ran me down is...
